    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Connecting to Alaska Airlines today?\nHere's how:\nSAN FRANCISCO\nINTERNATIONAL\n1\nFollow the signs to the AirTrain,\nAIRPORT\ntake the escalator or elevator\nto Mezzanine - Level 3\n2 Walk across the Sky-bridge and\nup one level to AirTrain platform\n3 Take the Red line to the\nInternational Terminal\nTerminal\n2\nVirgin\n4\nOnce inside the International\nTerminal, if you have your\nboarding pass, head to TSA\nSecurity area\nBags tagged for onward flights) will automatically\nbe transferred.\nIntl\nTerminal\nA\nHave a great flight today.\nNigin\namerica+ Alaska.",
      "Connecting to Virgin America today?\nHere's how:\n1\nFollow the signs to the\nAirTrain, escalator or\nelevator to train level\nSAN FRANCISCO\nINTERNATIONAL\nAIRPORT\nTerminal\n2\nVirgin\n2\nTake the Blue line to\nTerminal 2\n3\nOnce inside Terminal 2,\nif you have your\nboarding pass, head to\nTSA Security area\nIntl\nTerminal\nA\nBags tagged for onward flight(s) will automatically\nbe transferred.\nHave a great flight today.\nAlaska. + Ve\namerica\n2018.047.036"
